    32	
    33	Commit `8025475` changes no production file. Committed records behave as follows:
    34	
    35	- FULL sorts candidates by filename, not mtime, and tests every candidate newest-name-first at [depth_canon_launch.sh:387](worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_25_depth_canon_claude/depth_canon_launch.sh:387). Fresh-checkout mtimes are irrelevant. A newer FAIL cannot block an older qualifying PASS.
